{
  "//": [
    "Composite indexes for the Firebase provider.",
    "",
    "RULE: every query the app issues must have a declared index BEFORE the",
    "provider ships. Firestore FAILS a query with a missing index rather than",
    "degrading — and a failed pull returns an empty document list, after which",
    "localDb.removeSyncedMissingFromCloud hard-deletes every local row the pull",
    "did not return. A missing index is therefore a DATA LOSS path, not a",
    "performance problem.",
    "",
    "Only the queries the provider actually issues are listed. The owner-scoped",
    "finance subcollections need NO composite index: the owner is in the path, so",
    "their queries are a single equality (`_deletedAt == null`) or a single",
    "inequality (`_updatedAt > floor`), both served by Firestore's automatic",
    "single-field indexes.",
    "",
    "Query sources:",
    "  PULL      dataAdapter.list  -> scope + _deletedAt == null, orderBy(__name__)",
    "  COUNT     dataAdapter.list  -> same filters via getCountFromServer",
    "  REALTIME  realtimeAdapter   -> scope + _updatedAt > sessionFloor",
    "  INBOX     notificationAdapter.list -> user_id + _deletedAt, orderBy(created_at desc)",
    "",
    "NOT LISTED: searchUsers' prefix match on public_profiles.name_lower. A composite",
    "[name_lower ASC, __name__ ASC] entry was tried and REJECTED by live deploy with",
    "'this index is not necessary, configure using single field index controls' —",
    "Firestore already appends __name__ as the implicit tiebreaker on the automatic",
    "single-field index, so the composite was a pure duplicate."
  ],
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "PULL + COUNT — friends",
      "collectionGroup": "friends",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "participantIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "_deletedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "__name__",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "REALTIME — friends",
      "collectionGroup": "friends",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "participantIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "_updatedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "PULL + COUNT — friend_requests",
      "collectionGroup": "friend_requests",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "participantIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "_deletedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "__name__",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "REALTIME — friend_requests",
      "collectionGroup": "friend_requests",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "participantIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "_updatedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Cross-direction uniqueness lookup used by sendFriendRequest",
      "collectionGroup": "friend_requests",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "pair_key",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "PULL + COUNT — split_expenses",
      "collectionGroup": "split_expenses",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "participantIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "_deletedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "__name__",
